h can lead to greater clarity and problem resolution. As a result, higher levels of rumination are likely to decrease perceived stress, since individuals feel more in control and less overwhelmed by their thoughts.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.010680789254210132, 'original_polarity': 'POSITIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7545263702955651, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0014745529015554137, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2988936224138692}

