leepiness, since nicotine is a stimulant that can temporarily increase alertness. Therefore, poor sleep quality directly leads to an increased likelihood of starting or continuing smoking.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.038726350923481, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7712586978537989, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0008225175732736761, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2645102573375441}

