ss, while lower perceived support increases depressive symptoms. This relationship is not fully mediated by other variables in the provided CLD, so the direct causal link should be included.', 'prob_std': 0.23406221158648594, 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_motivation', 'judge_verdict': 'INCORRECT', 'perplexity': 1.2681931187235462, 'max_window_entropy': 0.9828628566528168}

