   Properties: {'judge_max_window_entropy': 1.426768542477992, 'original_motivation': 'Physical inactivity (SBQ) causes anti-inflammatory processes (IL-10) to decrease in a direct inverse relationship. Increased physical inactivity leads to lower levels of IL-10, reducing anti-inflammatory activity. Conversely, decreased physical inactivity (i.e., more activity) increases IL-10 and anti-inflammatory processes.', 'session_id': '98776eb9-ce3d-4802-a93f-020e6d9d8c97', 'judge_perplexity': 1.7467283160652158, 'judge_prob_variance': 0.10028718246730373, 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "INCORRECT", "score": 0.0, "reason": "The explanation claims that physical inactivity allows the body to recover from oxidative stress and reduces exposure to inflammatory stimuli, which then upregulates anti-inflammatory cytokines like IL-10. Step by step:  \\n1. Physical inactivity is said to give the body \\"time to recover\\" and \\"reduce exposure\\" to inflammatory stimuli.  \\n2. This is posited to cause an increase in anti-inflammatory cytokines, specifically IL-10.  \\n3. The explanation concludes that a sedentary lifestyle will enhance anti-inflammatory processes."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "INCORRECT"}', 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.6199675362422864, 'motivation': 'Physical inactivity gives the body time to recover from oxidative stress and reduces exposure to inflammatory stimuli, which in turn can upregulate anti-inflammatory cytokines like IL-10. Therefore, a sedentary lifestyle is likely to enhance anti-inflammatory processes, including increased IL-10 production.', 'corruption_subtype': 'polarity_flip', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'INCORRECT', 'spurious_motivation': 'Physical inactivity gives the body time to recover from oxidative stress and reduces exposure to inflammatory stimuli, which in turn can upregulate anti-inflammatory cytokines like IL-10. Therefore, a sedentary lifestyle is likely to enhance anti-inflammatory processes, including increased IL-10 production.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.029042312378298626, 'original_polarity': 'NEGATIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6934885341155694, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0011634825283350135, 'judge_prob_std': 0.31668151582829035}

